.env
.env.*
# Real env files the operator handles are named like dagmate.env / service.env /
# site.env / bot.env — none of which .env.* catches. `*.env` does. The committed
# templates end in .env.example and are NOT matched by this.
*.env
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.key
*.pem
*mnemonic*
*.mnemonic
# Seed material dumped to a file. Kept narrow on purpose — a broad `*seed*`
# would swallow committed source like service/tools/genseed.mjs.
seed.txt
*.seed
node_modules/
dist/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
state/
*-snapshot.json
*_card.png
# Internal security audits stay local — never in a public repo (they map past
# weaknesses and can carry local paths). Kept on disk, out of git.
docs/AUDIT_*.md
